2. विष्टि, इस्, इस्, इ (for 1. see p. 941, col. 2), per-
forming, labouring; (इस्), f. pervading, penetrating;
occupation, act, action; hire, wages; unpaid labour;
sending, dispatching; consigning to hell.

वि-षाद, अस्, m. dejection, depression, lowness of
spirits, despondency, want of energy, languor, lassi-
tude (especially as the result of unrequited love);
sadness, sorrow, affliction; disappointment, despair
(one of the Vyabhicāri-bhāvas); fear, weakness;
dulness, stupidity, insensibility (= मोह).

वि-शाय, अस्, m. sleeping and watching alternately
(applied to watchmen who sleep and watch by turns;
cf. उप-शाय).

वि-सर, अस्, m. going forth or abroad; going;
spreading, extending; a multitude, crowd, assemblage,
flock, herd.

वि-शेषणीय, अस्, आ, अम्, to be distinguished or
discriminated; to be marked as different or distinct;
to be particularized.

वि-शोध्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be purified or cleaned,
to be freed from taint or fault; to be rectified;
(अम्), n. a debt.

वि-श्रम, अस्, m. rest, repose, quiet; cessation
from labour or fatigue, remission of work, relaxation;
N. of a scribe.

वि-स्रब्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, trusted, confided in;
steady, diligent; tame, humble, placid, &c. (See
वि-श्रब्ध.)

), entire, whole, universal;
(अस्), m., N. of a kind of deity belonging to a class
of ten (forming one of the nine Gaṇas or classes
enumerated under Gaṇa-devatā, q. v.: in Ṛg-veda

);
adored or cherished by all, (Sāy. = विश्वैर् वरणीय,
Ṛg-veda

विषञ्ज् वि-षञ्ज् (-सञ्ज्), cl. 1. P. -षजति,
-षङ्क्तुम्, to attach to, fix or fasten to, fix on;
to hang or suspend upon (anything).

),
-ष्कम्भितुम् (Ved. Inf. विष्कभे, Sāy. = वि-
ष्कम्भणाय), to fix firmly, support, prop; to
obstruct; to fix asunder, fix separately, hold asunder;
to set free, allow to come forth, escape.

विष्पुलिङ्गक वि-ष्पुलिङ्गक, अस्, m. (or आ,
f. ?), Ved. a spark of fire (= वि-स्फुलिङ्ग, q. v.;
this word occurs in Ṛg-veda

),
to make a sound in eating, smack the lips (restricted
to this sense according to Pāṇ.

वि-सारिन्, ई, इणी, इ, going forth or in all directions,
spreading over or through, spreading, diffusing;
creeping along; flowing, gliding; (ई), m. a fish;
(इणी), f. a kind of shrub (= माष-पर्णी).
